* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_refit (reference/crafted.toml, 5 Nov 2026): demo12 variant 5,
* retrofits and lifetime extensions (docs/demo12-variants.md; User Note "Retrofits and Lifetime
* Extensions in TIMES", TIMES v4.1 User Note, March 2017, updated April 2023; Version.log
* 4.1.2, Mar 2017), added to TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0).
* Host process: the existing coal plant ELCTECOA00 (residual capacity to 2035). Options, each
* characterised as a full new technology (User Note): ELCLECOA01, a lifetime extension
* (PRC_REFIT +1), and ELCRFCOA01, an efficiency retrofit (PRC_REFIT -1).
* - REG1: options +1 and -1, chosen freely.
* - REG2: options +3 and -3 (|N| > 2: refitted capacity forced equal to the retired
*   capacity) and +4 on the host itself (PRC_REFIT(r,prc,prc): no cascading of forced
*   retrofits); ppmain.mod L485, prepret.dsc.
* Early retirement is enabled by demo12.run's DSCAUTO YES (User Note), so the case
* reaches prepret.dsc and EQL_REFIT.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET PRC
/
ELCLECOA01
ELCRFCOA01
/

SET PRC_MAP
/
REG1.ELE.ELCLECOA01
REG1.ELE.ELCRFCOA01
REG2.ELE.ELCLECOA01
REG2.ELE.ELCRFCOA01
/

SET PRC_TSL
/
REG1.ELCLECOA01.SEASON
REG1.ELCRFCOA01.SEASON
REG2.ELCLECOA01.SEASON
REG2.ELCRFCOA01.SEASON
/

SET PRC_ACTUNT
/
REG1.ELCLECOA01.ELC.PJ
REG1.ELCRFCOA01.ELC.PJ
REG2.ELCLECOA01.ELC.PJ
REG2.ELCRFCOA01.ELC.PJ
/

SET TOP
/
REG1.ELCLECOA01.ELC.OUT
REG1.ELCLECOA01.ELCCOA.IN
REG1.ELCRFCOA01.ELC.OUT
REG1.ELCRFCOA01.ELCCOA.IN
REG2.ELCLECOA01.ELC.OUT
REG2.ELCLECOA01.ELCCOA.IN
REG2.ELCRFCOA01.ELC.OUT
REG2.ELCRFCOA01.ELCCOA.IN
/

SET PRC_DESC
/
 REG1.ELCLECOA01 'Crafted: lifetime extension of ELCTECOA00 (TIMES.jl demo12_refit)'
 REG1.ELCRFCOA01 'Crafted: efficiency retrofit of ELCTECOA00 (TIMES.jl demo12_refit)'
 REG2.ELCLECOA01 'Crafted: lifetime extension of ELCTECOA00 (TIMES.jl demo12_refit)'
 REG2.ELCRFCOA01 'Crafted: efficiency retrofit of ELCTECOA00 (TIMES.jl demo12_refit)'
/

PARAMETER
ACT_EFF ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCLECOA01.ACT.ANNUAL 0.384
REG1.2005.ELCRFCOA01.ACT.ANNUAL 0.42
REG2.2005.ELCLECOA01.ACT.ANNUAL 0.384
REG2.2005.ELCRFCOA01.ACT.ANNUAL 0.42

/

PARAMETER
ACT_COST ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCLECOA01.MEURO05 0.5
REG1.2005.ELCRFCOA01.MEURO05 0.5
REG2.2005.ELCLECOA01.MEURO05 0.5
REG2.2005.ELCRFCOA01.MEURO05 0.5

/

PARAMETER
NCAP_COST ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCLECOA01.MEURO05 600
REG1.2005.ELCRFCOA01.MEURO05 300
REG2.2005.ELCLECOA01.MEURO05 600
REG2.2005.ELCRFCOA01.MEURO05 300

/

PARAMETER
NCAP_FOM ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCLECOA01.MEURO05 40
REG1.2005.ELCRFCOA01.MEURO05 40
REG2.2005.ELCLECOA01.MEURO05 40
REG2.2005.ELCRFCOA01.MEURO05 40

/

PARAMETER
NCAP_AFA ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCLECOA01.UP 0.85
REG1.2005.ELCRFCOA01.UP 0.85
REG2.2005.ELCLECOA01.UP 0.85
REG2.2005.ELCRFCOA01.UP 0.85

/

PARAMETER
NCAP_TLIFE ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCLECOA01 20
REG1.2005.ELCRFCOA01 15
REG2.2005.ELCLECOA01 20
REG2.2005.ELCRFCOA01 15

/

PARAMETER
NCAP_PKCNT ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCLECOA01.ANNUAL 1
REG1.2005.ELCRFCOA01.ANNUAL 1
REG2.2005.ELCLECOA01.ANNUAL 1
REG2.2005.ELCRFCOA01.ANNUAL 1

/

PARAMETER
NCAP_START ' '/
REG1.ELCLECOA01 2010
REG1.ELCRFCOA01 2010
REG2.ELCLECOA01 2010
REG2.ELCRFCOA01 2010

/

PARAMETER
PRC_CAPACT ' '/
REG1.ELCLECOA01 31.536
REG1.ELCRFCOA01 31.536
REG2.ELCLECOA01 31.536
REG2.ELCRFCOA01 31.536

/

PARAMETER
PRC_REFIT ' '/
REG1.ELCTECOA00.ELCLECOA01 1
REG1.ELCTECOA00.ELCRFCOA01 -1
REG2.ELCTECOA00.ELCLECOA01 3
REG2.ELCTECOA00.ELCRFCOA01 -3
REG2.ELCTECOA00.ELCTECOA00 4

/

